SUMMARY:W12: 30 min easy + 6 × 20 sec strides
DESCRIPTION:30 minutes easy\, then 6 repeats of 20 seconds smooth\, relaxed
  acceleration and 80 seconds walking or very easy jogging. Include recover
 y after the final repeat\, then 5 minutes easy. Total 45 minutes. Each str
 ide: build speed gradually\, briefly run quick and relaxed\, then ease dow
 n; never an all-out sprint. If 80 seconds is insufficient\, extend recover
 y. Use a flat\, clear surface.\nIf not recovered\, replace this with an ea
 sy run or rest. Do not stack a separate Nike workout on top.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
