SUMMARY:W22: 30 min easy
DESCRIPTION:Run 30 minutes at conversational effort\, about 2–4 out of 10
 . Walking breaks are welcome. No pace target.\nKeep this genuinely easy so
  Saturday parkrun and Sunday’s long run feel good. If your legs are tire
 d\, cut it to 15 minutes or rest.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
