DESCRIPTION:Run or run/walk 5 km at conversational effort. Keep it easy; th
 is is part of the weekly plan. Your long run is tomorrow\, so keep this tr
 uly easy. If your legs feel heavy\, walk or skip it. Don’t race parkrun 
 this block; if you ever do\, make Tuesday easy and shorten Sunday. Check t
 he local event start time and holiday availability.\n\nSummer preparation:
  choose an earlier/cooler time where practical\, plan water access\, and u
 se comfortable effort rather than chasing pace in the heat. Check UV and u
 se sun protection\, including on cloudy days. Broad-spectrum water-resista
