SUMMARY:W23: 20 min easy + 4 × 20 sec strides
DESCRIPTION:20 minutes easy\, then 4 repeats of 20 seconds smooth\, relaxed
  acceleration and 80 seconds walking or very easy jogging. Include recover
 y after the final repeat\, then 5 minutes easy. Total 31.6667 minutes. Eac
 h stride: build speed gradually\, briefly run quick and relaxed\, then eas
 e down; never an all-out sprint. If 80 seconds is insufficient\, extend re
 covery. Use a flat\, clear surface.\nIf not recovered\, replace this with 
 an easy run or rest. Do not stack a separate Nike workout on top.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
